{"_comment":"Editable copy for each home-page state. {price} etc. are filled from config. Sample text — rewrite freely.","home":{"landing":{"kicker":"OGITECH Student Awards","title":"The night we celebrate","highlight":"our brightest.","lead":"OGA recognises the students who lead, create and inspire across campus. Stay close — the next chapter is on its way.","ctas":[{"label":"About OGA","href":"about.html","variant":"ghost"},{"label":"Join the Committee","href":"committee.html","variant":"gold","feature":"committeeRecruitment"}],"sectionTitle":"What to expect","sectionLead":"More than a ceremony — a celebration of campus excellence.","highlights":[{"icon":"fa-trophy","title":"Meaningful categories","text":"Awards that honour leadership, creativity, academics and service."},{"icon":"fa-check-to-slot","title":"Fair, transparent voting","text":"Every vote is verified so the results you see are the results that count."},{"icon":"fa-ticket","title":"An unforgettable night","text":"Music, style and recognition, all in one carefully crafted evening."},{"icon":"fa-users","title":"Built by students","text":"Run by a dedicated committee of students, for students."}]},"nominations":{"kicker":"Nominations are open","title":"Step forward and","highlight":"be counted.","lead":"Register as a nominee, choose your category and tell your story. Approved nominees go straight to the voting round.","ctas":[{"label":"Register as Nominee","href":"register.html","variant":"gold"},{"label":"Nominee Login","href":"login.html","variant":"ghost"}],"sectionTitle":"How nominations work","sectionLead":"Three simple steps from sign-up to the ballot.","highlights":[{"icon":"fa-user-plus","title":"1. Register","text":"Create your nominee account with your details."},{"icon":"fa-list-check","title":"2. Choose a category","text":"Pick the category that best fits your story."},{"icon":"fa-circle-check","title":"3. Get approved","text":"Our team reviews entries and approves eligible nominees."}],"categoriesTitle":"Open categories","categoriesLead":"Find where you belong."},"voting":{"kicker":"Voting is live","title":"Your vote decides","highlight":"who takes the crown.","lead":"Pick your favourites and cast your votes securely. Every vote counts.","ctas":[{"label":"Vote Now","href":"vote.html","variant":"gold"},{"label":"Browse Categories","href":"categories.html","variant":"ghost"}],"sectionTitle":"How voting works","sectionLead":"Quick, secure and mobile-friendly.","highlights":[{"icon":"fa-magnifying-glass","title":"Find your nominee","text":"Browse by category or search by name."},{"icon":"fa-naira-sign","title":"Choose your votes","text":"Each vote costs {price}. Up to {maxVotes} votes per payment."},{"icon":"fa-shield-halved","title":"Pay securely","text":"Payments are processed and verified by our payment partner."}],"categoriesTitle":"Vote by category","categoriesLead":"Choose a category to see its nominees.","nomineesTitle":"Featured nominees"},"voting-closed":{"kicker":"Voting has closed","title":"Thank you for","highlight":"every single vote.","lead":"Votes are being verified. The winners will be revealed soon — stay tuned.","ctas":[{"label":"How It Works","href":"about.html","variant":"ghost"}],"sectionTitle":"What happens next","sectionLead":"We are making sure every result is accurate.","highlights":[{"icon":"fa-clipboard-check","title":"Verification","text":"Votes and payments are reconciled before results are published."},{"icon":"fa-trophy","title":"Winners revealed","text":"Winners are published here as soon as they are confirmed."},{"icon":"fa-champagne-glasses","title":"Awards night","text":"Celebrate the winners at the ceremony."}]},"results":{"kicker":"The results are in","title":"Meet the","highlight":"winners.","lead":"Congratulations to every nominee — and to the winners of this edition.","ctas":[{"label":"See All Winners","href":"results.html","variant":"gold"}],"sectionTitle":"Winners by category","sectionLead":"The students who took home the gold."}}}